            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="1092" n="[2182]" xml:id="pg2182"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations
                        of the United States</hi>, 1952–1954. Western Europe and Canada, Volume VI,
                    Part 2. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been revised.</p>
                <list>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 2169 (date
                            of correction: June 17, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>Non-existant page number (6569) deleted from entry for Germany, Federal
                        Republic of, under Soviet Union.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
